cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BookIndex (Zalizniakiada), please cite it using the metadata below."
title: >-
  BookIndex (Zalizniakiada): an interactive reference and corpus
  laboratory for the scholarly legacy of A. A. Zaliznyak
abstract: >-
  BookIndex is a self-contained, offline-capable web reference and
  digital-humanities workspace built around the books and public lectures of
  the Russian linguist A. A. Zaliznyak (1935–2017). It provides a corpus index
  (names, toponyms, ethnonyms, languages, lexicon and subject terms), a KWIC
  concordance, network and geospatial visualisations, a timecoded transcript
  corpus of the lecture videos, and Linked Open Data alignment (Glottolog,
  WALS, Wikidata, Starling). The dataset and software are compiled and
  maintained by Mārcis Gasūns; quoted excerpts and contexts from Zaliznyak's
  books and lectures are cited with permission of the rights holders.
type: software
authors:
